2a:T8d8,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why hire a Django expert instead of using Node.js or Go for backend development?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Django provides an unmatched \"batteries-included\" ecosystem with mature ORM capabilities, rock-solid security defaults (CSRF, SQL injection, XSS protection built-in), and an intuitive administrative interface out of the box. For SaaS platforms and data-intensive products, Python and Django allow you to build complex features in days rather than weeks."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Django backends scale to hundreds of thousands of concurrent users?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Industry leaders like Instagram, Pinterest, and Disqus run Django at massive global scale. Scalability depends on clean database normalization, avoiding synchronous I/O in the request-response cycle, leveraging Redis caching, and offloading heavy workloads to Celery background task workers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you structure Django REST Framework APIs for frontend and mobile consumption?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I architect DRF APIs using modular viewsets, strict serializer input validation, paginated responses, and granular permission classes. I generate interactive OpenAPI (Swagger) documentation automatically so frontend and mobile developers have clear endpoint specifications and mock payloads."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer ongoing Django consulting and maintenance for existing codebases?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Beyond greenfield engineering, I provide Django consulting retainers: upgrading legacy Django and Python versions, applying security patches, auditing slow PostgreSQL queries, and conducting comprehensive code reviews for growing engineering teams."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where do you deploy Django applications?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I deploy Django across modern Linux VPS hosts (Hetzner, DigitalOcean, AWS, Linode) using containerized Docker setups with NGINX, or fully managed platforms such as Render and Railway. I implement automated GitHub Actions CI/CD for continuous zero-downtime releases."}}]}18:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2a"}}]
